## Interface: 16001
## Title: Glowey's |cff73a0ffEssentials|r
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\DaylightEssentials\Media\icon.png
## Group: DaylightEssentials
## Notes: Works on its own, and integrates with Daylight UI when it's installed (its options window, look and profiles). Small combat aids: your healers' mana, a combat timer and alert, a pet reminder, your taunt and dispel cooldowns at the cursor, a list of enemy players nearby with a Kill on Sight list, your secondary stats, one-click buffs for players who buffed you, and Halo, a ring of your actions at the mouse. Each on its own switch.
